      "id": "claim_f4139884778b4be68b0f29ab6dfdd8dd",
      "statement": "The screenshot-launch-options Expo module is an iOS-only native module exposing simulator launch arguments (-appStoreScreenshotScene, -appStoreScreenshotLocale) to the App Store screenshot harness; its JS wrapper keeps the native lookup optional so Expo Go and Android still load, App.tsx guards the route with __DEV__, and it needs no plugin entry in app.config.ts because it is resolved via autolinking.",
