      "id": "claim_d01bed9687984c7d8cb7e7d37319ac9c",
      "statement": "The iOS client pairs via QR (POST /v1/pair through pinned-fetch), stores fingerprint, token, and device ID in the iOS Keychain, discovers the daemon via Bonjour browsing of _herdr-connect._tcp, and consumes /v1/agents plus SSE via TLS-fingerprint-pinned native modules; it requires an Expo development build.",
