      "statement": "LAN security uses TLS with a self-signed ECDSA P-256 certificate whose SHA-256 fingerprint mobile clients pin; per-device bearer tokens from QR pairing are stored only as SHA-256 hashes daemon-side, and there is no E2EE layer yet — TLS terminates at the daemon.",
